{"id":"9880eab1adc3d630","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-godel-tarski-undefinability.md","title":"Gödel-Tarski Undefinability of Truth","display":"thm-godel-tarski — Gödel-Tarski Undefinability of Truth","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-godel-tarski-undefinability","aliases":["57-thm-godel-tarski-undefinability"],"display":"thm-godel-tarski — Gödel-Tarski Undefinability of Truth","depends_on":["[[57-df-truth-predicate]]","[[57-df-godel-numbering]]","[[57-df-S-ar]]","[[57-df-numeral]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-godel-tarski-undefinability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-godel-tarski-undefinability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-godel-tarski — Gödel-Tarski Undefinability of Truth"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2d8f5002c4256603\" href=\"?note=2d8f5002c4256603\" title=\"57-df-truth-predicate\">57-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e637b613a7ac0c5\" href=\"?note=6e637b613a7ac0c5\" title=\"57-df-S-ar\">57-df-S-ar</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"afc42c965ba86683\" href=\"?note=afc42c965ba86683\" title=\"57-df-numeral\">57-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Gödel-Tarski-Undefinability-of-Truth\">Gödel-Tarski Undefinability of Truth</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N\">\\(\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6e637b613a7ac0c5\" href=\"?note=6e637b613a7ac0c5\" title=\"57-df-S-ar\">57-df-S-ar</a> 的标准算术结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 为固定变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2d8f5002c4256603\" href=\"?note=2d8f5002c4256603\" title=\"57-df-truth-predicate\">57-df-truth-predicate</a>；代入数码取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"afc42c965ba86683\" href=\"?note=afc42c965ba86683\" title=\"57-df-numeral\">57-df-numeral</a>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{True}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{True}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}(\\varphi)\\)</span> 是本原子下式定义的句子真理谓词，语义结构固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N\">\\(\\mathfrak N\\)</span>；它的自变量为语法公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{True}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\land\\mathfrak N\\models\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{True}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\land\\mathfrak N\\models\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\;\\left[\\mathrm{FV}(\\tau)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{True}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak N\\models\\tau[\\underline{g(\\varphi)}/x]\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\;\\left[\\mathrm{FV}(\\tau)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{True}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak N\\models\\tau[\\underline{g(\\varphi)}/x]\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>算术真理不可在算术中定义</li>\n<li>自我指用的基本限制</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Gödel-Tarski-Undefinability-of-Truth","text":"Gödel-Tarski Undefinability of Truth","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"2d8f5002c4256603","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"373da07803c26744","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-S-ar","status":"resolved","id":"6e637b613a7ac0c5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-S-ar]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"afc42c9